 * Backoff: `BACKOFF_MS_BASE * 2^attempt` (100ms, 200ms, 400ms). 4xx responses
 * NEVER retry — they're always permanent for the same request shape, and
 * burning subrequests on 401/404 wastes the CF Workers budget.
